{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_030_clip-title\">CLIP</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">完全分离的图像/文本双塔，通过批内 N×N 对称对比目标对齐，并用文本 prompt 充当开放词表分类器。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Aligns separate image and text encoders in a shared embedding space via symmetric in-batch N×N contrastive loss, turning text prompts into zero-shot classifiers.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">批量图像与自然语言文本配对</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Mini-batch of N paired (image, natural-language caption) samples</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">共享嵌入空间中的图像/文本向量与零样本类别分数</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">L2-normalized shared-space image/text embeddings and cosine zero-shot classification logits</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v139/radford21a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_030_clip')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_030_clip')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"CLIP original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/311e6533af3fc6ce2cd7.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_030_clip', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_030_clip\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_030_clip')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_030_clip', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_030_clip\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图像批次</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">N 幅图像构成视觉分支输入。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests mini-batch of n paired (image, natural-language caption) samples and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"N 幅图像构成视觉分支输入。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests mini-batch of n paired (image, natural-language caption) samples and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"图像批次\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_030_clip', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图像批次</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">N 幅图像构成视觉分支输入。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests mini-batch of n paired (image, natural-language caption) samples and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"ResNet 或 ViT 将每幅图像编码为一个全局向量。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Image Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Image Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_030_clip', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Image Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">ResNet 或 ViT 将每幅图像编码为一个全局向量。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"线性投影并 L2 归一化到共享 d 维球面。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection + Norm within the core dual tower image text contrastive computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"图像投影 + Norm\" data-node-name-en=\"projection + Norm\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_030_clip', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图像投影 + Norm</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection + Norm</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">线性投影并 L2 归一化到共享 d 维球面。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection + Norm within the core dual tower image text contrastive computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"与图像配对的 captions，零样本时替换为类别 prompt。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 04 within the core dual tower image text contrastive computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"文本批次\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 04\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_030_clip', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">文本批次</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 04</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">与图像配对的 captions，零样本时替换为类别 prompt。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 04 within the core dual tower image text contrastive computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"因果 Transformer 取 EOT token 作为句子表示。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Text Transformer within the core dual tower image text contrastive computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Text Transformer\" data-node-name-en=\"Text Transformer\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_030_clip', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Text Transformer</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">因果 Transformer 取 EOT token 作为句子表示。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Text Transformer within the core dual tower image text contrastive computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"线性投影并 L2 归一化到同一嵌入空间。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs projection + Norm within the core dual tower image text contrastive computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"文本投影 + Norm\" data-node-name-en=\"projection + Norm\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_030_clip', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">文本投影 + Norm</span><span class=\"lang-en\">projection + Norm</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">线性投影并 L2 归一化到同一嵌入空间。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs projection + Norm within the core dual tower image text contrastive computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"所有图像与所有文本做余弦相似度并乘可学习温度尺度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs N×N matrix within the core dual tower image text contrastive computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"N×N 相似矩阵\" data-node-name-en=\"N×N matrix\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_030_clip', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">N×N 相似矩阵</span><span class=\"lang-en\">N×N matrix</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">所有图像与所有文本做余弦相似度并乘可学习温度尺度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs N×N matrix within the core dual tower image text contrastive computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"图像找文本与文本找图像的交叉熵取平均。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies CE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"双向 CE\" data-node-name-en=\"CE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_030_clip', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">双向 CE</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图像找文本与文本找图像的交叉熵取平均。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies CE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"候选类别写成文本模板，图像按与各文本向量的相似度分类。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces l2-normalized shared-space image/text embeddings and cosine zero-shot classification logits via Prompt.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"Prompt 分类\" data-node-name-en=\"Prompt\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_030_clip', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Prompt 分类</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Prompt</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">候选类别写成文本模板，图像按与各文本向量的相似度分类。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces l2-normalized shared-space image/text embeddings and cosine zero-shot classification logits via Prompt.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"CLIP Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · CLIP 图文双塔的对称批内匹配</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Symmetric Bidirectional In-Batch Image–Text Contrastive Alignment</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"CLIP：核心公式 · CLIP 图文双塔的对称批内匹配\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"30\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"25.220101pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" ver