x=\"11.804739\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g16-150\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"36.18991\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g10-76\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"43.851172\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g20-67\" y=\"-52.19763\"></use><use x=\"48.702081\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g20-76\" y=\"-52.19763\"></use><use x=\"53.14572\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g20-73\" y=\"-52.19763\"></use><use x=\"55.567541\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g20-80\" y=\"-52.19763\"></use><use x=\"62.876613\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g1-61\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"73.175695\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g20-49\" y=\"-57.617279\"></use><rect height=\".557905\" width=\"3.636358\" x=\"73.175695\" y=\"-56.531355\"></rect><use x=\"73.175695\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g20-50\" y=\"-50.254903\"></use><use x=\"78.904205\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g4-2\" y=\"-61.811542\"></use><use x=\"82.421008\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g23-67\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"89.066088\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g23-69\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"95.651395\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g10-185\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"99.566713\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g16-40\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"104.88674\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g16-150\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"109.555846\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g16-30\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"113.60066\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g10-186\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"119.630202\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g10-184\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"128.180304\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g23-67\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"134.825383\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g23-69\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"141.410691\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g10-185\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"145.326009\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g16-40\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"150.646036\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g7-62\" y=\"-57.806571\"></use><use x=\"156.322351\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g16-150\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"160.991457\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g16-30\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"165.036271\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g10-186\" y=\"-53.692011\"></use><use x=\"169.051204\" xlink:href=\"#m030_g4-3\" y=\"-61.811542\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">监督分类器只能识别固定类别，类别标签表达有限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Closed-set classifiers could not generalize to unseen diagnostic categories or leverage rich free-text clinical descriptions.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">双编码器以对称图文对比损失建立开放词汇共享嵌入空间</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Train dual image and text encoders jointly on 400M image–text pairs to maximize cosine similarity of true pairs against N²−N negatives.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">海量图文弱监督、prompt zero-shot 与高效检索</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Scalable dual-encoder contrastive pretraining + natural-language prompt templates enabling zero-shot open-vocabulary transfer.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">奠定 CXR-report、病理-caption 和医学 zero-shot VLM 路线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Foundational blueprint for ConVIRT, GLoRIA, BioViL, BiomedCLIP, CONCH, and multimodal radiology/pathology retrieval.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">医学 VLM 基础设施；global embedding、false negatives 与校准仍有限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Core VLM infrastructure; global pooled vectors lack fine spatial localization and require calibration before clinical thresholding.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">批内配对矩阵把自然语言监督转化为大规模图文匹配分类。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">双塔只在最终嵌入空间交互，可分别预计算图像或文本向量并高效检索。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">类别名称经 prompt 编码后成为动态分类器权重，从而不训练新分类头即可零样本预测。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Train dual image and text encoders jointly on 400M image–text pairs to maximize cosine similarity of true pairs against N²−N negatives.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Scalable dual-encoder contrastive pretraining + natural-language prompt templates enabling zero-shot open-vocabulary transfer.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Symmetric Bidirectional In-Batch Image–Text Contrastive Alignment.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">自由文本报告可提供比单一诊断标签更丰富的监督，但否定、历史病变和报告模板会制造配对噪声。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">零样本医学分类高度依赖术语和 prompt 设计；跨机构验证与校准优先于仅报告 AUROC。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Foundational blueprint for ConVIRT, GLoRIA, BioViL, BiomedCLIP, CONCH, and multimodal radiology/pathology retrieval.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Core VLM infrastructure; global pooled vectors lack fine spatial localization and require calibration before clinical thresholding.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v139/radford21a.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Learning Transferable Visual Models From Natural Language Supervision</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/openai/CLIP\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
